Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumble Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effect of the rumble\Nball lasts three minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.99,0:02:03.62,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(733,644)\bord1.9\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(691,733,\1a&H00&)\t(3944,3986,\1a&HFF&)}The Skies of Drum
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.99,0:02:03.62,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(733,644)\c&HE7E6E5&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Skies of Drum
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the time I need to take\Nyou down. Three minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't defeat me in three\Nyears, let alone three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.09,0:02:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just three?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just three?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.31,0:02:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be an interesting battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.81,0:02:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you old bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me up so I can help. Rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no match!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not against this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marimo Snow Melting Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.99,0:02:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock point! Light boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a transformation, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.21,0:02:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was expecting something more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.01,0:02:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to show\Nare Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a Snow type, just like Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a reindeer human, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.91,0:02:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy point! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a human reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:02:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know everything\Nthere is to know about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the three form transformations\Nyou sometimes use!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marimo's Big Super Surprise, Kaido Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of surprises, you've\Ngot none left to spring on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen all your forms. Now you're nothing\Nmore than a power fighter like Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's no way you can -\NJumping point, jump, boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.75,0:03:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the jump on me! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, that guy can really jump. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.68,0:03:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that form?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't his human and animal form\Nthe little reindeer from earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guard Point: Third Boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.37,0:03:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hit you dead on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.83,0:04:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Zone types have a three form limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rumble Ball is a Special\NPill that enhances the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Devil Fruits' transformations over\NFive long years of research I discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For additional transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.75,0:04:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A seven form transformation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible. I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A talking reindeer who can\Nchange into seven forms?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend, what's the matter with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just so much happiness of meeting\Na transforming reindeer a guy can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard, did you\Nforget about fighting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be deceived by what\Nhas to be an obvious sham.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arm point!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arm boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you thought that was something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.59,0:05:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should see what my iron\Nhooves can do against rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my hammers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What nerf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These'll teach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Firemo's Super Surprise Katorea Axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow-Splitting Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, damn, that reindeer\Ncan really take a hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.87,0:05:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you dodged it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.65,0:05:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see you dodge this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the directional soul splitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna take me down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:05:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not fighting, you're just dodging!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brain point, brain boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't just dodging your swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was looking for your weak spot. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll finish you. Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna shoot a beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No he won't, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you it's gotta be a beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know that, huh, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smart Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, what kind of beam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ginormous...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The castle's unguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for my weak spot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got some news for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little transforming parlor\Ntricks can't save you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as you're about to find out, you're\Nthe one who's going to be finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His job!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.13,0:07:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:08:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! All right! Wow! Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Where is he? Where's who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tin-plated bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.53,0:08:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since his hippo got knocked away,\NI doubt he could have snuck off very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how? When'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably when you were drooling\Nover those transformations!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sneaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think he ran off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, there's not much up\Nhere, just the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Nami's all alone in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he lays a finger on her, I'll chop\Nhim up and feed him to the sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.77,0:08:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess the\Nnincompoop has a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I go away and this is what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drumcastle used to be a stately palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's nothing but a rundown\Nhobble filled with snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did they do to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:09:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I won't let them get away with this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chew them up until\Nthere's absolutely nothing left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get Vivi home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.19,0:09:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spent enough time resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ian doesn't seem to be around, so maybe\NI can slip away without her noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What the? Who's he? Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another Straw Hat, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, what's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir, but I don't\Nknow what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.07,0:09:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm just a traveler who is passing\Nthrough and I'm actually on my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.93,0:09:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice talking to you, see ya. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king of this country\Ncommands you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.05,0:10:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, you big creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have gained weight recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much, much, factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turned into a bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My miraculous bone structure\Nshaping technique is now complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaning on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.59,0:11:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to gobble you up, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that guy Big Fatso before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you mind telling me\Nwhy the code I kindly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,loaned you is all torn\Nup before I murder you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how\Nmuch I paid for that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,28,800 berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was after hackling!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, I didn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That loudmouth over there did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault he shot a cannon at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then in that case, Luffy,\NI guess I can forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known that\Nyou would have never brought
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it back in good condition\Nwhen I let you borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can just pay me back at my usual 300\N% interest, which comes to $100,000. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have said!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never have taken it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.62,0:12:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still gotta kick your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one doing the butt-kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind me lies this castle's arsenal, and\NI'm the only one who has the key to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside its walls are some of the\Nmost fearsome weapons known to man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.49,0:12:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is\Ndevour them, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then my much-much shock will\Nmake them part of my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you'll be forced to\Nface a fearsome living
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.21,0:12:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weapon the likes of\Nwhich you've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready to die, Straw\NHats, because I'm going... Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's getting away! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I've got another trump card!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be the key to the\Narsenal he was yapping about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, why couldn't it have been the\Nkey to this castle's treasure vault?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crawling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm great now that I've\Nseen you, Nami dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there are two things that'll\Nmake me feel even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could just rest my\Nhead on your warm billowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.51,0:13:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get away from\Nme, you stupid loudmouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The upper levels are full of snow too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trash my castle and defy\Nmy orders, will they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:14:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time I taught those\Ninsupport, and it's a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A painful lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do so, I'll use the ultimate\Nweapon of the entire Wano Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My devastatingly lethal Tin Titan\NRoyal Crown Seven Barrel Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.15,0:14:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got you cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.43,0:14:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snowbird's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you laugh at me! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Ian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy. Did you hear him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He called me his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, I was skeptical when I\Nheard about this ropeway to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.35,0:15:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here it is, just like\Nthe young man told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't it used to be Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.07,0:15:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great view from this thing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but isn't it just the\Nteensiest bit overcrowded?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let Dalton go\Nalone when he's injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fight alongside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.75,0:15:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're so overloaded, it'll\Ntake forever to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:15:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta pedal faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, please just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.27,0:16:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no medicine that\Ncan cure fools, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you call me the king a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, do you think you're some hero who\Nspeaks for the lowly subjects of my kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.05,0:16:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A week in this cell\Nwill give you plenty of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.99,0:16:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to reflect on your\Nmistake there's nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like Prison to change a\Nman's attitude and just
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in case that doesn't work\NI'm going to have that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rebellious streak beaten\Nout of you you're an
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excellent god in the\Ncitizens trust don't be a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool apologize to the\Nking and show him respect
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton that dead doctor\Nhere look was an idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.83,0:16:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you fell for his nonsense,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,risking your status\Nand insulting the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:16:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you a full pardon, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is get on\Nyour knees and say the following.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.97,0:17:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, oh great King Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.57,0:17:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always know what's\Nright for this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with status.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare mock me too, stupid bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the king of drum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.07,0:17:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you're a\Nking or even if you're a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you're someone who's\Ngreat or someone who's not so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still going to kick your lousy butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does matter, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drum Kingdom is a member\Nof the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means this is a capital\Noffense because I'm the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, Big Mouth, it doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.81,0:17:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King or no king, I'm taking you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take you down first, Strahan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this will!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much, much shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tang Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His tongue turned into a cannon! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, someone help me lift him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, can you hear me? Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't die, you just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:18:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not until I put an end to Wobble\Nand what he's done to this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A government should care about\Nits country and its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.99,0:19:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you weren't joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you really think, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A government doesn't need to have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just needs to control the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.11,0:19:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.99,0:19:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have patients who will\Ndie if I don't treat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw him in the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he resists, you have my\Npermission to shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.44,0:19:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of my patients at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who are going to suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with controlling the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, and none of them are sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show them what happens to a\Ncountry that doesn't have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.37,0:20:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we arrive, take cover, because\Nonce I'm inside, there'll be explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He let his guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pollock is talking! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.67,0:20:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E, it certainly seems\Nlike it's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to mess with that flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm finally gonna kick your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.19,0:21:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.81,0:21:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a battle of the position!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something going\Non on top of the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.39,0:21:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This...is kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.73,0:21:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drum kingdom, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.95,0:21:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you Vice King!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.73,0:21:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.45,0:22:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Drum Kingdom was ultimately\Ndefeated by the skull and crossbones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.87,0:22:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll brave whatever dangers lie ahead\Nand let you know when it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.57,0:22:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.93,0:23:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.93,0:23:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watching your back\Nhiding behind someone like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.93,0:23:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you even come if you're so scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.47,0:23:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scared don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.23,0:23:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always laugh at the face of danger
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do that, you moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.71,0:23:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't recognize you at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.97,0:23:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were more of Big\NMouse guards coming to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm really surprised you\Nguys came all the way up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.75,0:23:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not you, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.13,0:23:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, Usopp, aren't you normally scared\Nof doing stuff like climbing mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:23:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever there's a towering peak\Nin front of me, I get to climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.45,0:24:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me tell you, scaling that\Nmountain hand over hand was no picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.51,0:24:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, we took a\Nropeway car up here, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.87,0:24:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tommy and Sanji, are they all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.97,0:24:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, both of them are just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.23,0:24:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.75,0:24:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me tell you,\Ntaking it was no picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.03,0:24:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.94,0:24:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were on the way, then a giant condor\Nflew out of nowhere and attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.85,0:24:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what was that you were doing on\Ntop of the castle a few minutes ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.77,0:24:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beating the crap out of the king. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.07,0:24:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.07,0:24:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that person I saw flying\Nthrough the air was actually Wapol?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.79,0:24:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You beat him? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.87,0:24:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.78,0:24:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I threw a rope around his neck\Nand show that bird who was boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.45,0:24:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.36,0:24:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.28,0:24:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his two henchmen,\Nwhat happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.29,0:24:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, the reindeer beat them\Nup. What? Those two? A reindeer?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.97,0:24:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.63,0:24:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.54,0:24:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a new friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.61,0:24:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you gotta meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.67,0:24:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.58,0:24:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.59,0:24:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reindeer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.11,0:25:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A reindeer...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.43,0:25:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.13,0:25:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.51,0:25:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for those who had the\Nnerve to laugh at Heronut's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.61,0:25:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without enough strength,\Nyou'd only die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.67,0:25:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.09,0:25:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sacrifice it for this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.41,0:25:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Nose, you never gave up, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.87,0:25:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still kept fighting, believing\Nin what this country could become.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.21,0:25:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, thanks to you, Trump\NKingdom, it can finally be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.69,0:26:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that strange creature\Nbehind that tree? It almost
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.79,0:26:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a reindeer. No,\Nyou're wrong. It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.93,0:26:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.57,0:26:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Yeti!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.67,0:26:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.58,0:26:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.95,0:26:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk face!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.07,0:26:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a Yeti, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.97,0:26:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my new friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.65,0:26:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys scared him so bad, he ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.21,0:26:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bring him back so you\Ncan meet him, you jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.07,0:26:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.05,0:26:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.37,0:26:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to introduce you to my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.05,0:26:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop running for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.63,0:26:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my friends wouldn't meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.47,0:26:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just because I don't know you yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.37,0:26:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.75,0:26:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.05,0:26:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends are back that\Nway, don't you wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.79,0:26:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, this is for the best, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.59,0:27:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not so bad, you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.55,0:27:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back and meet them,\Nthey're my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.97,0:27:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends like yours,\NI don't need anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.37,0:27:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're\Ngoing to be okay, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.45,0:27:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.83,0:27:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just feeling a little drained, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.07,0:27:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.31,0:27:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.91,0:27:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's good to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.69,0:27:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be useful and take the\Ninjured guy to the medical ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.41,0:27:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you really should stay and\Nhave your illness completely treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.49,0:27:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.81,0:27:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't escape from here now, we won't\Nbe able to set sail for two more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.23,0:27:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how worried Vivi is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.81,0:27:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get her to Alabats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.27,0:27:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit all this grumbling and\Nget back to the medical ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.31,0:27:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.47,0:27:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.81,0:28:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected, his injuries have\Ngotten worse due to overexertion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.67,0:28:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.77,0:28:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, surely you would know\Nwhere the key to the arsenal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.61,0:28:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.61,0:28:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arsenal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.75,0:28:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you need to get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.81,0:28:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really none of\Nyour business, now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.55,0:28:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol always carried that key with\Nhim to keep it secure, he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.83,0:28:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case, the key was likely\Nblown into the sky with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.41,0:28:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.32,0:28:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.24,0:28:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.79,0:28:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Ean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.09,0:28:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think we can talk about your\Nfee for treating our crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.49,0:28:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you waive it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.61,0:28:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and could you go ahead and\Ndischarge me right now as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.09,0:28:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.15,0:28:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you should know better\Nthan that by now, girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.73,0:28:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my medical fee,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.89,0:28:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be taking all of the cargo and\Nmoney you have on that ship of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.57,0:29:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you will stay here and\Nrecover for two more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.33,0:29:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, she's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.77,0:29:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to complete your treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.51,0:29:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.42,0:29:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even feel like\NI'm gonna die anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.09,0:29:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't exactly a\Nvery convincing reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.75,0:29:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key to the arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.59,0:29:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you needed, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.93,0:29:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you end up with that key?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.79,0:29:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's truly the real one,\Nhow'd you get a hold of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.99,0:29:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.89,0:29:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've certainly got some guts trying\Nto negotiate with me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.37,0:29:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are an unbelievably\Nfrustrating little girl, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.15,0:29:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.37,0:29:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to pay my doctor's fee,\Nbut that's as much as I'll agree to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.19,0:29:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a doctor, I can't allow you\Nto leave in good conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.21,0:29:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.33,0:29:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.24,0:29:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'm afraid\Nwe don't have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.35,0:29:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.43,0:29:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen here, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.09,0:29:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to leave you alone now\Nand go take care of a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.61,0:29:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look in the back room, you might\Nfind a dresser with one of my coats in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.45,0:30:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not exactly like I'm\Nposting any guards on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.35,0:30:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, the young man with the spinal fissure\Nshould be well enough to travel by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.51,0:30:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, girl, don't you even\Nthink about trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.67,0:30:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some heavy lifting for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.37,0:30:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.57,0:30:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she really just tell us to steal\Nher coat, get Sanji, and sneak out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.69,0:30:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.17,0:30:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it sounded like to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.23,0:30:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure have been running a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.77,0:30:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night came before I realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.21,0:30:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hear that rubber guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.45,0:30:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I finally shook him, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.71,0:30:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.65,0:30:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.25,0:30:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.77,0:30:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a full moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.09,0:31:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.81,0:31:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are still looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.01,0:31:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.11,0:31:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just give it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.59,0:31:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been tracking him forever,\Nand he still hasn't shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.73,0:31:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not interested in becoming a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.65,0:31:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just going to have to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.39,0:31:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.73,0:31:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want the reindeer to\Nbe a pirate with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because you want something\Ndoesn't mean it's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.71,0:31:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't want\Nto go with them. Reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.75,0:31:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.66,0:31:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever you are, reindeer, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.61,0:31:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.39,0:31:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing like them, the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.71,0:31:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reindeer guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.83,0:31:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.97,0:31:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kay, you're gonna come on our\Nship and be a pirate with us, kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.61,0:32:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.52,0:32:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you can't, reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.97,0:32:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a whole lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a very good argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.55,0:32:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.33,0:32:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a human, I'm a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.47,0:32:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have antlers and hooves, don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.05,0:32:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even have a blue nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.33,0:32:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've heard his story, do you\Nthink you can heal the scar on his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.47,0:32:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, maybe I do want to be a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.05,0:32:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't ever be one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.79,0:32:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not human! I'm a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.99,0:32:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be your friend and I can't\Nbecome a pirate on your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.27,0:32:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.27,0:32:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just here to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.97,0:32:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.63,0:32:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you asking\Nme to join your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.97,0:32:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was really nice, so thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.85,0:32:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.93,0:33:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you wanted to, you could\Nstop by here again. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.33,0:33:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.51,0:33:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaahhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.25,0:33:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most people don't make friends\Nby telling someone to shut up.

